			Fires a brimstone bolt that explodes into more bolts on death
			'''
	}

	PhoenixBlade: {
		DisplayName: Phoenix Blade
		Tooltip: Enemies explode and emit healing flames on death
	}

	Trinity: {
		DisplayName: Trinity
		Tooltip: Fires a spread of energy bolts
	}

	FulgurationHalberd: {
		DisplayName: Fulguration Halberd
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Inflicts burning blood on enemy hits
			Right click to use as a spear
			'''
	}

	Mariana: {
		DisplayName: Mariana
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Tropical and deadly
			Enemies explode into water orbs on hit
			'''
	}

	AquaticDissolution: {
		DisplayName: Aquatic Dissolution
		Tooltip: Fires whaling spears from the sky that bounce off tiles
	}

	Impaler: {
		DisplayName: Impaler
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Fires explosive and flaming stakes
			Instantly kills vampires and vampire bats
			'''
	}

	SpectreRifle: {
		DisplayName: Spectre Rifle
		Tooltip: Converts musket balls into powerful homing souls
	}

	StarCannonEX: {
		DisplayName: Star Cannon EX
		Tooltip: Fires a mix of normal, starfury, and astral stars
	}

	BrimstoneFlameblaster: {
		DisplayName: Brimstone Flameblaster
		Tooltip: Fires bouncing brimstone fireballs
	}

	HadopelagicEcho: {
		DisplayName: Hadopelagic Echo
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Fires a string of bouncing sound waves that become stronger as they travel
			Sound waves echo additional sound waves on enemy hits
			'''
	}

	CrystalFlareStaff: {
		DisplayName: Crystal Flare Staff
		Tooltip: Fires blue frost flames that explode
	}

	BouncingBetty: {
		DisplayName: Bouncing Betty
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Throws a grenade which bounces after exploding
			Stealth strikes explode into a violent blast of fire and shrapnel when it bounces
			'''
	}

	LatcherMine: {
		DisplayName: Latcher Mine
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Sticks to enemies on hit and detonates after 3 seconds
			Breaks upon hitting blocks
			Stealth Strike Effect: On explosion, fire and shrapnel are released
			Stealth strike mines can stick to the ground and last much longer when doing so
			'''
	}

	Quasar: {
		DisplayName: Quasar
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Succ
			Stealth strikes spawn more explosions
			'''
	}

	MarkedMagnum: {
		DisplayName: Marked Magnum
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Shots reduce enemy protection
			This weapon scales with all your damage stats at once
			'''
	}

	PurifiedJam: {
		DisplayName: Purified Jam
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Makes you immune to all damage and most debuffs for 10 seconds
			Causes potion sickness when consumed
			Cannot be consumed while potion sickness is active
			'''
	}

	RevivifyPotion: {
		DisplayName: Revivify Potion
		Tooltip: Causes enemy attacks to heal you for a fraction of their damage
	}

	Dualpoon: {
		DisplayName: Dualpoon
		Tooltip: Launches two harpoons
	}

	Triploon: {
		DisplayName: Triploon
		Tooltip: Launches three harpoons
	}

	ArcanumoftheVoid: {
		DisplayName: Arcanum of the Void
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Spawns A Void Barrier around you that shields you from A hit
			You release Dark Energy when you get hit and the barrier breaks
			This effect has a 90 second cooldown which is shared with all other dodges and effects
			'''
	}

	ExoGladius: {
		DisplayName: Exo Gladius
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Do not underestimate the power of Exoblade`s younger brother
			Striking an enemy with the blade causes an explosion
			Shortflurry attacks deflect projectiles
			'''
	}

	MicrocellCut: {
		DisplayName: Microcell Cut
		Tooltip: fires homing astral stars everytime you kill an enemy
	}

	Seabow: {
		DisplayName: Seabow
		Tooltip: Fires slow-moving water blasts
	}

	RedtideSword: {
		DisplayName: Redtide Sword
		Tooltip: Throws short-range whirlpools
	}

	UrchinSpear: {
		DisplayName: Urchin Spear
		Tooltip: Poisons enemies and fires short-range stingers
	}

	UrchinFlail: {
		DisplayName: Urchin Flail
		Tooltip: Launch an urchin ball, which shoots a spike on contact with an enemy
	}

	SeashellBoomerang: {
		DisplayName: Seashell Boomerang
		Tooltip: Stealth strikes fire seashells at nearby enemies
	}

	CursedCapper: {
		DisplayName: Cursed Capper
		Tooltip: Fires cursed bullets
	}

	LuminousStriker: {
		DisplayName: Luminous Striker
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Send the stars back to where they belong
			Throws a stardust javelin trailed by rising stardust shards
			Explodes into additional stardust shards upon hitting enemies
			Stealth strikes cause the stardust shards to fly alongside the javelin instead of rising
			'''
	}

	TheReaper: {
		DisplayName: The Reaper
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Slice ‘n dice
			Stealth strikes throw four at once
			'''
	}

	WarbanneroftheSun: {
		DisplayName: Warbanner of the Sun
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Increases melee damage, true melee damage and melee speed the closer you are to enemies
			Max boost is 20% increased melee damage, true melee damage and melee speed
			'''
	}

	RustyMedallion: {
		DisplayName: Rusty Medallion
		Tooltip: Causes most ranged weapons to sometimes release acid droplets from the sky
	}

	AlchemicalFlask: {
		DisplayName: Alchemical Flask
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Inflicts the player with the Plague debuff
			2% increased damage
			'''
	}

	RedBow: {
		DisplayName: Red Bow
		Tooltip:
			'''
			+10 maximum stealth
			Enemies are less likely to target you
			'If you're cuter, monsters won't hit you as hard.'
			'''
	}

	WulfrumBlade: {
		DisplayName: Wulfrum Blade
		Tooltip: ""
	}

	WulfrumBow: {
		DisplayName: Wulfrum Bow
		Tooltip: ""
	}

	WulfrumStaff: {
		DisplayName: Wulfrum Staff
		Tooltip: Casts a wulfrum bolt
	}

	MarniteBayonet: {
		DisplayName: Marnite Bayonet
		Tooltip: The gun damages enemies that touch it
	}

	ChargedDartBlaster: {
		DisplayName: Charged Dart Blaster
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Fires a shotgun spread of darts and a splitting energy blast
			Right click to fire a more powerful exploding energy blast that bounces
			'''
	}

	Lazinator: {
		DisplayName: Lazinator
		Tooltip: Zap
	}

	AccelerationRound: {
		DisplayName: Acceleration Round
		Tooltip: Gains speed over time
	}

	CadancePotion: {
		DisplayName: Cadance Potion
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Gives the cadance buff which reduces spawn rates
			Increases life regen and increases max life by 25%
			Increases heart pickup range
			While this potion's buff is active, Regeneration Potion and Lifeforce Potion buffs are disabled
			'''
	}

	CrumblingPotion: {
		DisplayName: Crumbling Potion
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Increases melee and Spy critical strike chance by 5%
			Melee and Spy attacks break enemy armor
			'''
	}

	ShatteringPotion: {
		DisplayName: Shattering Potion
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Increases melee and Spy damage and critical strike chance by 8%
			Melee and Spy attacks break enemy armor
			While this potion's buff is active the Crumbling Potion's buff is disabled
			'''
	}

	FrigidBulwark: {
		DisplayName: Frigid Bulwark
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Absorbs 25% of damage done to players on your team
			Only active above 25% life
			Grants immunity to knockback
			Puts a shell around the owner when below 50% life that reduces damage
			The shell becomes more powerful when below 15% life and reduces damage even further
			'''
	}

	MeleeLevelMeter: {
		DisplayName: Melee Level Meter
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Tells you how high your melee proficiency is
			While equipped you will gain melee proficiency faster
			'''
	}

	RangedLevelMeter: {
		DisplayName: Ranged Level Meter
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Tells you how high your ranged proficiency is
			While equipped you will gain ranged proficiency faster
			'''
	}

	MagicLevelMeter: {
		DisplayName: Magic Level Meter
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Tells you how high your magic proficiency is
			While equipped you will gain magic proficiency faster
			'''
	}

	SummonLevelMeter: {
		DisplayName: Summon Level Meter
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Tells you how high your summon proficiency is
			While equipped you will gain summon proficiency faster
			'''
	}

	SpyLevelMeter: {
		DisplayName: Spy Level Meter
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Tells you how high your Spy proficiency is
			While equipped you will gain Spy proficiency faster
			'''
	}

	HolographicChessboard: {
		DisplayName: Holographic Chessboard
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Challenges a nearby Brain of Cthulhu to a game of chess
			Solve 3 problems in a row without hurting it to tame it
			With no boss around, lets you practice
			'''
	}

	SoothingService: {
		DisplayName: Soothing
		Tooltip: The Zoologist soothes this boss so it can be tamed again
	}

	MetabolicConverter: {
		DisplayName: Metabolic Converter
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Permanently unlocks the usage of Rage and Adrenaline
			Revengeance drop
			'''
	}

	MandibleBow: {
		DisplayName: Mandible Bow
		Tooltip: ""
	}

	RaidersGlory: {
		DisplayName: Raider's Glory
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Fires ichor arrows with increased velocity
			These arrows also cause enemies to drop more money
			'''
	}

	BittercoldStaff: {
		DisplayName: Bittercold Staff
		Tooltip: Fires a spread of homing ice spikes
	}

	ShadowdropStaff: {
		DisplayName: Shadowdrop Staff
		Tooltip: Summons dark aura rain from the sky
	}

	HellBurst: {
		DisplayName: Hell Burst
		Tooltip: Casts a beam of flame
	}

	WulfrumLeechDagger: {
		DisplayName: Wulfrum Leech Dagger
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Drains a percentage of enemy health on hit
			Cannot inflict critical hits
			Shortflurry attacks make the weapon unconsumable for 3 seconds
			'''
	}

	Tomatus: {
		DisplayName: Tomatus
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Enemies explode on hit
			Shortflurry attacks inflict Hellfire
			'''
	}

	NightsStabber: {
		DisplayName: Night's Stabber
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Don't underestimate the power of stabby knives
			Enemies release homing dark energy on hit
			Shortflurry attacks heal the player, spawn night vines,
			Inflict Cursed Inferno, and increase melee speed
			'''
	}

	LeechingDagger: {
		DisplayName: Leeching Dagger
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Enemies release homing leech orbs on hit
			Shortflurry strikes heal the player for 5 health per hit
			'''
	}

	BloodyRupture: {
		DisplayName: Bloody Rupture
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Enemies release homing blood orbs on death
			Shortflurry attacks create bloodsplosions on enemy hits
			'''
	}

	AncientShiv: {
		DisplayName: Ancient Shiv
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Enemies release a blue aura cloud on death
			Shortflurry attacks increase melee speed by 5%
			'''
	}

	EutrophicShank: {
		DisplayName: Eutrophic Shank
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Shoots electric sparks
			Shortflurry attacks inflict Eutrophication
			'''
	}

	AquaticDischarge: {
		DisplayName: Aquatic Discharge
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Enemies release electric sparks on death
			Shortflurry attacks paralyze enemies
			'''
	}

	Weapons: {
		Rogue: {
			AcidicRainBarrel: {
				DisplayName: Acidic Rain Barrel
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a rolling barrel that explodes on wall collision
					Stealth strikes make it rain on collision
					'''
			}

			Nychthemeron: {
				DisplayName: Nychthemeron
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a spiky ball that ignores gravity and summons a pair of light and dark orbs that orbit the player
					Once the spiky ball disappears the orbs will home in on the nearest target
					Stacks up to 10
					Stealth strikes cause all spiky balls and orbs to be thrown at once
					Right click to recall all existing spiky balls
					'''
			}

			HellsSun: {
				DisplayName: Hell's Sun
				Tooltip:
					'''
					The Subterranean Sun in the palm of your hand.
					Shoots a gravity-defying spiky ball. Stacks up to 10.
					Once stationary, periodically emits small suns that explode on hit
					Stealth strikes emit suns at a faster rate and last for a longer amount of time
					Right click to delete all existing spiky balls
					'''
			}

			PoisonPack: {
				DisplayName: Poison Pack
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a poisonous spiky ball. Stacks up to 3.
					Stealth strikes cause the balls to release spore clouds
					Right click to delete all existing spiky balls
					'''
			}

			MonkeyDarts: {
				DisplayName: Monkey Darts
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Stealth strikes throw 3 bouncing darts at high speed
					'Perfect for popping'
					'''
			}

			SkyStabber: {
				DisplayName: Sky Stabber
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Shoots a gravity-defying spiky ball. Stacks up to 4.
					Stealth strikes make the balls rain feathers onto enemies when they hit
					Right click to delete all existing spiky balls
					'''
			}

			StickySpikyBall: {
				DisplayName: Sticky Spiky Ball
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a spiky ball that sticks to everything
					Stealth strikes throw seven at once and last a lot longer
					'''
			}

			BouncySpikyBall: {
				DisplayName: Bouncy Spiky Ball
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a very bouncy ball that richochets off walls and enemies
					Receives a small boost in damage and velocity after bouncing off an enemy
					Stealth strikes provide a bigger boost after richocheting
					'''
			}

			PhantomLance: {
				DisplayName: Phantom Lance
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Fires a spectral javelin that rapidly releases lost souls
					Fades away and slows down over time
					Lost souls released later deal less damage
					Stealth strikes don't slow down and souls always deal full damage
					'''
			}

			Sandslasher: {
				DisplayName: Sandslasher
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a huge shuriken made out of fused sand unaffected by gravity which slowly accelerates horizontally
					It does more damage depending on how fast it goes horizontally and how long it has been flying for
					Stealth strikes periodically release sand clouds
					'''
			}

			Phlegm: {
				DisplayName: Phlegm
				Tooltip: ""
			}

			PoisonIBee: {
				DisplayName: Poison I-Bee
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws out disks which release thorns upon hitting enemies
					Stealth strikes cause the disk to fling out seeds in random directions
					'''
			}

			ShockGrenade: {
				DisplayName: Shock Grenade
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a grenade that explodes into a burst of lightning
					Stealth strikes cause the grenade to leave an electrifying aura when it explodes
					'''
			}

			NightsGaze: {
				DisplayName: Night's Gaze
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Strike your foes with this spear of the night
					Throws a spear that shatters when it hits an enemy
					Stealth strikes cause the spear to summon homing stars as it flies
					'''
			}

			CatastropheClaycore: {
				DisplayName: Catastrophe Claycore
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Tosses claycore-type bombs that explode into energy bolts on impact
					Stealth strikes cause bombs to explode into more bolts
					'''
			}

			Warglaive: {
				DisplayName: Warglaive
				Tooltip: Stealth strikes stick to tiles
			}

			AlphaVirus: {
				DisplayName: Alpha Virus
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Throws a giant plague cell with a lethal aura that splits into 6 plague seekers on death
					Stealth strikes cause the plague cell to move slower, accumulating an aura of swirling plague seekers as it flies
					'''
			}
		}
	}
}

