Taming: {
	Tamed: "{0} has been tamed!"
	SupremeCalamitasQuit: Supreme Calamitas can't go on... Now, press Alt+F4.

	Wrestle: {
		Button: Arm Wrestle
		Reveal: Hmph. You keep coming back... Fancy an arm wrestle, youngster? Beat me and maybe my curse will listen to you.
		Title: Arm wrestling the Old Man
		OldMan: Old Man
		You: You
		Help: Click (or Space) when the notch is in the zone; the middle counts double. Escape to give up.
		Won: You win! The curse relents...
		Lost: The Old Man wins.
	}

	OldManGames: {
