		SimonWon: Perfect memory!
		SimonLost: Wrong tile...
	}

	Taxes: {
		Button: File Draedon's taxes
		Chat: Draedon hasn't filed his taxes in centuries! Pay me 1 platinum and I'll file them for him... his machines will calm down.
